          </div>
          <p class="smaller text-muted mb-0" data-i18n="birdnetpi.steps.step2.comparison.a.desc">Focused on core backend code efficiency, daemon runtimes, backup/restore systems, and support for the latest 64-bit Bookworm & Trixie OS releases.</p>
